              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "выпуск (výpusk) — \"a bulletin, an issue, an edition\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "В вечернем выпуске новостей говорили о погоде. V vechérnem výpuske novostéy govoríli o pogóde. In the evening news bulletin they talked about the weather."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Выпуск новостей — a news bulletin; also an issue of a magazine."
            }
          ]
        },
