          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "выпуск (výpusk) is built on выпускать \"to let out, to issue\", from пускать \"to let go\", inherited from Proto-Slavic pustiti (EtymDB): what is let out to the public."
