          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "статья (statyá) is usually traced to the root of стать \"to stand, to become\", inherited from Proto-Slavic stati (EtymDB), with an old sense \"a part in its place\"; EtymDB lists no parent for статья (statyá) itself."
